  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='0. Desc. &amp; Introduction'>
      <repository-location id='0_Desc_Introduction' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/AssortmentAdditionsDevdashboardnew' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1100' maxwidth='1450' minheight='1100' minwidth='1450' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98546' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98896' x='552' y='727'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Introduction (WIP)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Regions are deciding on the assortment and assortment size based on the competitors&apos; reports, benchmarks, some internal/regional tools/vendors. It&apos;s challenging to have a competitive assortment to lead the market always. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Assortment Additions Insights Dashboard</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> is the solution for catalog managers to decide on what to add into our assortments in regions/countries. The main goal of having this tool/report is to find the category and/or SKU gaps between the assortments of our regions&apos; and the competitors&apos;.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Below are the description for each dashboard pages and KPIs:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>1. Assortment Comparison</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This dashboard gives insights on different time levels (Weekl and Monthly) for each Entity with its competitor assortment size. It shows the Avg. Content Score, Completeness, and Quality score from the latest week&apos;s data. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>2. Matched SKU on DH Assortment</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This page displays the information of matched SKUs of different competitors on DH assortment.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>3. Category Mapping</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This view is a precursor to the the next  view i.e </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>SKU level Information. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>4. SKU level Information</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This view is a on SKU level from the competitor side to find the gap in our assortment</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>5. Assortment Distribution across Categories</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This view shows the distribution of SKUs across categories for both our entity as well as the competior</run>
              <run>Æ





































</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#898989' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='14' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98546' id='13' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98896' x='552' y='727'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98546' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98896' x='552' y='727'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Introduction (WIP)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Regions are deciding on the assortment and assortment size based on the competitors&apos; reports, benchmarks, some internal/regional tools/vendors. It&apos;s challenging to have a competitive assortment to lead the market always. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Assortment Additions Insights Dashboard</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> is the solution for catalog managers to decide on what to add into our assortments in regions/countries. The main goal of having this tool/report is to find the category and/or SKU gaps between the assortments of our regions&apos; and the competitors&apos;.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Below are the description for each dashboard pages and KPIs:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>1. Assortment Comparison</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This dashboard gives insights on different time levels (Weekl and Monthly) for each Entity with its competitor assortment size. It shows the Avg. Content Score, Completeness, and Quality score from the latest week&apos;s data. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>2. Matched SKU on DH Assortment</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This page displays the information of matched SKUs of different competitors on DH assortment.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>3. Category Mapping</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This view is a precursor to the the next  view i.e </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>SKU level Information. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>4. SKU level Information</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This view is a on SKU level from the competitor side to find the gap in our assortment</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14' underline='true'>5. Assortment Distribution across Categories</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This view shows the distribution of SKUs across categories for both our entity as well as the competior</run>
                    <run>Æ





































</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#898989' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{7B793D33-0FE6-4C72-83D6-21463147B898}' />
    </dashboard>
